ed before you overspend\n- Insights with category breakdown and weekly spending charts\n- Monthly PDF reports you can save or share\n\nIPON MADE FUN\n- Savings goals with progress tracking and celebrations\n- Round-up savings: every expense sends the spare change to your first goal — automatically\n- 52-Week Challenge with a real piggy bank: end it anytime and every peso goes back to your wallet\n- Daily streak to keep you logging\n\nNEVER MISS A BILL\n- Bills with real due dates and countdown\n- Reminders the day before and on the due day — even when the app is closed\n- Recurring salary, rent, and subscriptions post automatically\n\nFOR OFWs\n- See your balance in USD, AED, SAR, SGD, or EUR with daily exchange rates\n\nYOUR DATA, PROTECTED\n- PIN stored in the iOS Keychain, Face ID unlock, auto-lock, and a privacy cover in the app switcher\n- Your data syncs securely to your own private cloud space — only your account can read it\n- Sign in with email, Google, or Apple\n\nPay once. Save forever. Kaya mo 'yan.", "trackCensoredName": "Kaya: Budget & Ipon Tracker", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/kaya-budget-ipon-tracker/id6787639857?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "genreIds": ["6015", "6007"], "userRatingCount": 0}]}